Error [E0022]: `interface` is spelled `trait` in Jet
  --> tests/ui/foreign_trait.jet:1:1
    |
  1 | interface Drawable {
    | ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: traits are written with `trait` — see docs for `trait Name { … }`
 Fix: replace `interface` with `trait`

Error [E0003]: expected `{` to open the function body, found `;`
  --> tests/ui/foreign_trait.jet:2:18
    |
  2 |     fn draw(self);
    |                  ^
 Why: the structure here isn't what the compiler expected
 Fix: use `{` to open the function body
